
Fact object Identified by Flower

Fact nearby Identified by actor * object

Fact owner-of Identified by actor * object

Event break Related to object
  Syncs with destroy(actor, object) When nearby()

Act destroy 
  Actor actor
  Related to object
  Creates promise-to-compensate() When owner-of(actor', object)

Duty promise-to-compensate 
  Holder actor
  Claimant actor'
  Related to object.

+actor(Alice).
+actor(Bob).
+owner-of(Alice, Flower).
+owner-of(Bob, Knife).
+nearby(Bob, Flower).

?!Enabled(break(Flower)). // not enabled but not reported, as no actor/intent
?!Enabled(destroy(Bob,Flower)). // not enabled, thus reported (as actor, implied intent)
break(Flower).

?promise-to-compensate(Bob, Alice, Flower).
